      "content": "yeah i've been keeping a log. it's not just the windbreakers though. i noticed that whenever i go to the cafe on 4th street, the guy at the corner table always looks up from his phone at the exact same time i walk in. it's like he's timed. and my friend mark has been acting super weird too, asking me a lot of random questions about my \"daily routine\" lately. like why would he care about my routine unless someone was asking him? i feel like i'm being watched by more than just neighbors.",
